WEBVTT

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.570
<i>Tsukai Saraka was actually one of the 
anisotropic beings who created this universe.</i>

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.250
<i>When Saraka learned of 
Yaha-kui zaShunina's plan</i>

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>to take humanity into the anisotropic,</i>

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.580
<i>she used her power to stop 
him, but was defeated.</i>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.270
<i>Saraka fled into an isolated space,</i>

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:34.870
<i>where she healed the wounds of 
the badly injured Shindo Kojiro,</i>

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.600
<i>and shared with him her feelings from 
when she came into the universe.</i>

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.560
<i>Meanwhile, zaShunina used a clone of Shindo</i>

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>to help him spread the 
fourth anisotropic device,</i>

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.860
<i>the Nanomis-hein, to the rest of humanity.</i>

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.660
A dream?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.760
Wanoraru

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.510
<b>What is the Nanomis-hein?</b>

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:40.870
The ability to use the Nanomis-hein 
exists equally within all people.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.360
First, you must touch it.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.200
That's where it all begins.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:53.370
An Important Message 
About the "Nanomis-hein"

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:57.900
<b>Shinjuku Station 
Nanomis-hein Special Space</b>

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:06.320
<b>Algiers</b>

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.560
<b>Beijing</b>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.310
<b>Moscow</b>

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.990
What's going on outside?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.200
All the world's governments, including Japan,

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:30.460
as well as all the global 
mega-corporations like SETTEN,

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.330
are doing everything they can 
to spread the Nanomis-hein.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.720
This will bring humanity into 
contact with another tool

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:40.580
from the anistropic after the Wam and Sansa.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:43.420
More will gain a sense of the anisotropic.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:47.100
If humanity gains a sense of the anisotropic,

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.710
it makes the transformation 
to it more likely to succeed.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:55.390
It's likely that everything zaShunina 
has done so far was for that purpose.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:05:01.220
My first question is this: is there 
any way to stop zaShunina by force?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.570
What's that?

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.560
An isolator.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:16.210
You could call it a cage to seal 
away an anisotropic being.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.870
If you can make him touch this, 
you can seal zaShunina inside.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.910
However, for that to happen...

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.180
You'll need to get rid of the Fregonics.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.800
Is that possible?

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:36.200
A physical object like Kado is one thing,

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.430
but when two anisotropic beings collide,

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:42.260
it just becomes a battle to see 
who can output more energy.

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.070
And...

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.320
And?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.650
You lack Fregonics of your own.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:52.620
Standing against an anisotropic being 
would mean suicide for you.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.910
If he wanted to,

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:01.250
zaShunina could crush your 
heart where you stand.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.580
So unless we have a way

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.780
to get rid of the Fregonics, 
there's no way to stop him by force?

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.260
Maybe...

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.490
There is one way.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.920
This one is for single components,

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.440
and so is this one, so how 
many components are there?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.510
27? 36? 37?

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:24.380
Is that a lot? But you'd need a lot.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.090
There's a lot of ordinals, too. 5? 8?

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.250
More! This is crazy!

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:28.740
It's all tangled together!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.900
So this itself is the tensor and the meter...

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.280
I see! I see!

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.370
It's surprisingly simple!

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:55.230
So in the end, it just ends up self-similar?

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:57.290
<b>Prime Minister's Residence
In Front of Large Meeting Room</b>

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.810
That's okay, though. It's an editor.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.480
So the part that deals with 11 is... here?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.880
What? What? What? What?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.770
I'm sorry, Dr. Shinawa,

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.520
for basically kidnapping you...

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:17.200
Dr. Shinawa, can you help us?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.660
Me?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:27.250
I'm going to get something to eat.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:34.510
Hanamori's down.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:38.620
He was close to Saraka-san.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.940
Saraka-san was an anisotropic being.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:51.270
She feared humanity's growth and development,

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.740
and tried to stop me from sharing 
anisotropic technology with you.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.020
Don't hurt me!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:10.500
I don't have any money! 
All I have is mapo tofu!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.090
Perfect.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.070
I was just feeling hungry.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.850
Huh? Shindo-san?

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:19.850
What's going on?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.710
Tsukai-san!

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.230
Dr. Shinawa?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:27.890
Why?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.800
Hanamori, I need your help.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:42.040
<b>Live Broadcast</b>

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:38.710
<i>First, it's important to find those 
with the greatest ability to use it,</i>

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:42.040
<i>and deepen understanding 
of the Nanomis-hein.</i>

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:47.420
<i>The research will take time, 
but in the future,</i>

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.240
Coming!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:53.180
<i>each household and each individual 
will have their own Nanomis-hein.</i>

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:50.700
Huh?

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.560
H-Huh?

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.930
Shindo-san?!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.430
Hello again.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.970
Osakabe Plating

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.850
Can you do it?

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:13.150
A human-made Fregonics 
generator and neutralizer?

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:17.910
Dr. Shinawa is currently 
working on the final theory.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.720
Can't you just go public with this?

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.840
Tell the whole world about what 
Yaha-kui zaShunina is planning,

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.830
and that the other Shindo is a fake?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.620
If I show my face in public,
zaShunina will kill me in an instant.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.220
Besides, the other "me" is just as real as I am.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:42.660
If one disappears, everyone 
will just believe the other.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.430
But...

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.100
I want to bet on this chance.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.440
I need this device, no matter what.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.360
To defeat an anisotropic being?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.250
No.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:59.700
To negotiate with an anisotropic being.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.630
Nomura-kun, shut down the 
line and gather everyone here.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:10.330
Boss...

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:12.840
Let's do this!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:15.920
Yes, sir!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.110
Osakabe-san!

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.460
Nobody else in the world could do this,

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.840
but we can!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:26.990
We have the supermetal we 
made with you, after all!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.610
zaShunina!

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:37.210
I wanted to talk a little about how 
we handle the Nanomis-hein overseas...

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.570
zaShunina?

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:44.990
I leave it in your hands.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.980
You what? Listen...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.260
I'll come back later, okay?

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.800
Shindo-san.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.440
Can we talk for a bit?

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.440
What are you going to negotiate with him?

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.500
You can't have any kind of real 
negotiations with zaShunina.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.130
There's too great a difference 
in your respective strengths.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.660
Even if that weapon is completed,

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.600
it may simply delay your 
death for a moment.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:38.460
What are you going to talk 
to someone like that about?

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:48.930
It's true that this is the most 
difficult negotiation I've ever done,

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.940
because this is a negotiation 
where I can't talk.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.710
zaShunina said he wanted information.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.880
More information than he could ever process.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.450
That's an instinctive desire 
for anisotropic beings.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:10.050
But just having enough 
information isn't sufficient.

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:13.950
Given time, you can process it all.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.790
Being unable to process it all means

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.430
taking in a huge amount of 
information in a short period.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:24.020
It means being given a 
collection of information.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.640
Put more simply,

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:31.560
all that needs to happen is 
something he doesn't expect.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.260
Yaha-kui zaShunina wants to be surprised,

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:40.180
so I can't talk to him first.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.860
Surprises require secrets.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:49.070
The goal of negotiation is to 
give both sides what they want.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.870
So that's not a weapon,

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:55.130
but a tool to give him 
the shock of his life.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:13:00.660
That's what he really wants.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.640
You're an idiot!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:15.020
He's trying to destroy humanity, 
and you're going to grant him his wish?

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.020
Shindo-san, you're a huge idiot!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:28.950
I'm sorry.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:44.670
Don't cry, Saraka-san.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.520
The sky's so clear...

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.500
It's fall now.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.750
Yaha-kui zaShunina arrived in summer.

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.610
Time flies.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:49.530
It's been a hell of a three months.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.850
In these three months,

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:57.530
it feels like humanity's been made 
to advance several hundred years.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:07.610
I pray that this advancement leads 
the next generation to happiness.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.190
Sorry I'm late.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:27.130
Shindo-san, we're fine here. Rest a bit.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.190
It's starting.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:44.830
There it is! Just like the math said!

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:43.740
It worked!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:46.210
Human-made Fregonics!

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.720
I'm calling it Antagonics!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.590
Antagonics...

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.490
If you force two pairs of Wam

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.720
to interact with one another, you can create

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:04.380
a countercurrent that goes 
opposite the anisotropic.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.420
Like antimatter!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.790
When it contacts Fregonics,

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:10.320
the two interfere with one 
another and disappear.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:14.020
This should allow you to break the Fregonics.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.330
You can use the angle of your 
hand to control the output.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.500
This could work...

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:23.870
Come to think of it, what are 
you going to use this for?

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.900
I'm going to stop Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.750
Why? Why?

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:33.450
Because he's trying to take 
mankind to the anisotropic.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.690
Thank you.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.850
I won't forget this.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.520
Save the world and we'll call it even.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:48.620
<i>Take people... to the anisotropic?</i>

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.010
Shindo-san.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:53.610
Saraka-san?

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.610
Are you ready?

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:58.670
I think so.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:03.700
Did you tell him?

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:05.490
Everything.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.090
Hanamori...

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.180
Are you really doing this?

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.460
Yeah.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.220
You're too selfish, Shindo-san.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:22.950
Always...

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:26.190
Why do you ask me to do this stuff?

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:30.670
Even if it works, you'll...

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:36.350
I thought about asking Asano 
or Natsume to do this.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.240
I can count on them.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.700
But, Hanamori,

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:46.050
it was you who was always with me.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.710
I think you know me better than anyone.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:52.960
So...

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.170
I want to leave it in your hands, Hanamori.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.180
Hanamori.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:05.930
Take care of the rest.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.620
Shindo.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.530
These are the Wam you made.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.260
Do you remember?

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:43.760
First, I gave humanity the Wam.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.730
The Wam broke the universe's 
laws of conservation

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.100
and proved the existence
 of the anisotropic.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.920
The Wam are a "window" that connect 
the anisotropic and the universe.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.260
Next, I gave them the Sansa.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.940
The Sansa are the "eyes" of the anisotropic

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:13.790
that give humanity the ability 
to feel the anisotropic.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.600
Then the Nanomis-hein.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.900
The Nanomis-hein are the 
"hands" of the anisotropic

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.940
that give humanity the ability 
to touch the anisotropic.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:32.630
I opened the window, gave you 
eyes, and offered you hands.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:38.220
Humanity's advancement 
will only accelerate now.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:53.330
Preparations to take humanity 
to the anisotropic are complete,

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:56.550
Shindo.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.060
Hey! zaShunina!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.730
Shindo-kun?

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.030
Shindo-kun!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.030
Natsume, wait!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.700
Shindo-kun just... Shindo-kun just...!

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:30.370
No! Let me go!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.370
Crap, it's coming this way!

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:34.180
No, Shindo-kun!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.370
We're getting out of here, Natsume!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.630
What's going on?

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.810
Get me the emergency hotline!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.130
Run!

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:45.370
What's going on?

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.800
Is the anisotropic behind this?!

00:20:57.930 --> 00:20:58.810
An earthquake?

00:20:58.810 --> 00:20:59.980
What's going on?

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:06.740
There's no... sky?

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.170
The formulas are being solved.

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:31.760
The ultimate cocoon, the universe,

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:34.130
exists for this moment...

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:47.530
zaShunina.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.160
Let's talk.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:58.170
I've missed you,

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.300
Shindo.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:38.830
Our first priority is to 
keep our people safe!

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:41.390
There's only one thing we 
should be broadcasting.

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:43.320
You have no way of stopping it.

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:45.570
Shindo, I will...

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:47.610
zaShunina!
